flowchart TB
  Browser[Браузър: Razor Views / HTML / CSS / JS] --> MVC[ASP.NET Core MVC Controllers]
  MVC --> Service[Бизнес услуги: заявки, пунктове, правила]
  Service --> EF[EF Core DbContext / Репозитории]
  MVC --> EF
  EF --> SQL[(MS SQL Server: RePointDb)]
  MVC --> Identity[ASP.NET Core Identity / Roles / Cookies]
  Identity --> EF
